      "slug": "artisanal-epistemology",
      "label": "Artisanal Epistemology",
      "category_type": "ANALYST_TERM",
      "definition_short": "Knowledge embodied in bodily practice, sensorial engagement, and craft mastery. Rooted in hands-on experimentation, tacit understanding, and apprenticeship transmission. Pamela Smith argues this epistemology was foundational to the Scientific Revolution.",
