      "slug": "operational-chemistry",
      "label": "Operational Chemistry",
      "category_type": "ANALYST_TERM",
      "definition_short": "The practical, reproducible manipulation of matter to achieve specific chemical transformations: distillation, calcination, metallurgical refining, pharmaceutical extraction. Alchemists' operations were empirically successful; only theoretical explanation changed over time.",
