      "slug": "material-culture-approach",
      "label": "Material Culture Approach",
      "category_type": "ANALYST_TERM",
      "definition_short": "Study of objects, apparatus, production centers, and sensorial properties to understand historical knowledge and practice. Reveals regional variation, trade networks, manufacturing innovation, and embedded expertise. Recovers knowledge lost to textual silence.",
